            I’m <strong>Rishi Srivastava</strong>, a university student pursuing a <strong>B.Tech in Electronics and Communication Engineering</strong>. 
            My passion for electronics started early—fidgeting with home electronics always got me scolded, so I took up <strong>electronics engineering</strong> where I could finally burn some circuits <em>without</em> getting into trouble! 🔥
          </p>

